<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3501 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3501 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3501 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.0100 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 27		  May 26</p>
<p> High			     75.5503		 75.2550</p>
<p> Low				75.3501		 75.0000</p>
<p> Open			     75.5500		 75.2550</p>
<p> Close			    75.3501		 75.0100</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.110		   4.785</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
